    "reason": "[ev-ebd92acd21f4] is one step of a procedure in the upgrade guide, followed by [ev-45ef39303832] \"Run this command from that directory\". It does not describe a change in Loki 3.0.0. It names no setting, behaviour or requirement that changed, and it does not say the step is mandatory or what happens if it is skipped. Because of that, no exposure condition follows from the evidence. The proposed edge-from-version <3.0.0 condition would flag every upgrade from 2.x for a migration the text never requires, which is a broader condition than the evidence supports. The real 3.0 changes in this section, such as the schema requirement in [ev-5dacaee98643] and the shared_store removal in [ev-1d0876135bde], are separate items.",
